    "segments create": "Create a Segment.

Usage:
  splitch segments create [flags]

Flags:
  --app <app>              [type: string; default: SPLITCH_APP or config] App ID or slug.
  --name <name>            [type: string; default: none] Resource name.
  --body-json <json>       [type: JSON object; default: none] Request body fields; see Request body below.
  --idempotency-key <key>  [type: string; default: generated] Stable retry key for this mutation.
  --json                   [type: boolean; default: false] Write machine-readable JSON to stdout.
  -h, --help               [type: boolean; default: false] Show help and exit.

Request body (--body-json):
  name             required  string
  description      optional  string
  conditions       required  { attribute: string; operator: string ("eq" | "neq" | "gt" | "lt" | "gte" | "lte" | "in" | "not_in" | "matches" | "not_matches"); value: boolean | string | number | unknown[] }[]
  idempotency_key  optional  string
  Example:
    {"name":"name","conditions":[{"attribute":"attribute","operator":"eq","value":true}]}

Example:
  splitch segments create --body-json '{"name":"name","conditions":[{"attribute":"attribute","operator":"eq","value":true}]}' --json",
