  get             Get a Metric.
  update          Update a Metric (decision-valid edits gated by DECISION_LOCKED).
  delete          Delete a Metric (blocked if referenced by a running Experiment).

Flags:
  -h, --help  [type: boolean; default: false] Show help and exit.

Example:
  splitch metrics list --help",
